'''Large Iron Ball''' (大玉 (鉄), ''Ōdama (Tetsu)'', '''Large Ball (Iron)''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Large Iron Ball
|image = E 578.png
|appearance = [[River City Stages#River City Ball-Rolling|River City Ball-Rolling]]<br>
[[New Year's Bling]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 6|Infernal Tower - Floor 6]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
Much like the other Balls from the event, it's really weak by itself, but quite tough in groups, particularly when buffed. By nature of having the Metal trait and one knockback, it is the tankiest of the Balls, but has slow speed.

==Strategy==
Quick attackers such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] or [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] can chip its health pretty fast, and any [[Critical Hit]] will take it out instantly no matter what due to its pathetic 20 health, so units like [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] are perfect for defeating them. With its abysmal range of 100, you can also easily use [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Panties Cat (Special Cat)|Lollycat]] to slow it down.

